<title>JAPAN: U.S. TO ATTEND IMF THAI MEETING ON MONDAY - SOURCE.</title>
<headline>U.S. TO ATTEND IMF THAI MEETING ON MONDAY - SOURCE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States will attend a meeting in Tokyo on Monday hosted by the International Monetary Fund (IMF) to discuss a package of measures to help Thailand cope with its economic woes, a financial source said on Friday.</p>
<p>Heading the U.S. delegation will be Timothy Geithner, senior deputy assistant secretary of the Treasury for international affairs, the source said.</p>
</text>
